      </div>
      <article class="prose-shopify mt-14 max-w-4xl">
        <p>Illustrative proposals throughout the scenarios, notes and deep dives below: timings and caps are test inputs, not observed results or verified capabilities of either supplier. Model contribution as AOV × (margin − discount), with unchanged product cost; discount loss is AOV × discount. These figures exclude additional shipping, payment, messaging and return costs. Before every queued action, check current purchase, refund, stock and suppression state and permission for that channel and marketing purpose. Assign one queue owner, pause overlapping flows, and deduplicate replayed events by cart, customer and action; test those checks before enabling any channel.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 1 — international shipping quote sticker shock. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 1 favors SMS urgency; watch for discount on email one before trust proof. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 2 — subscription toggle left on at checkout. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 2 favors push nudge; watch for SMS after 9pm local without quiet hours. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 3 — first-time mobile shopper on Instagram traffic. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 3 favors no-discount assist; watch for no suppression after partial refund. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 4 — size matrix with two variants OOS. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 4 favors email proof; watch for attribution credit on would-have-returned orders. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 5 — gift message field abandoned mid-flow. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 1 favors SMS urgency; watch for recovery for fully OOS cart. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 6 — high-AOV cart with financing widget opened. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 2 favors push nudge; watch for duplicate SMS and email within 20 minutes. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Attentive vs Mailchimp: scenario 7 — bundle discount not applied in cart. At $245 AOV and 38% margin, full-price recovery contributes $93.10 vs $44.10 after a 20% code (Δ $49.00). Ladder touch 3 favors no-discount assist; watch for welcome discount stacking with cart code. Email 1 ~94m, email 2 ~49h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
